00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,000
Allergy Pass Can AI read restaurant allergy notes well enough to keep guests safe? One model, three ways: Decisions, the ordinary API picking options, and the ordinary API writing food names. Code checks every dish every 5 minutes.

